{
  "company_name": "CargoSight Analytics",
  "industry": "Logistics",
  "use_case": "Load demand forecasting and shipment volume prediction",
  "space_title": "CargoSight Analytics - Load Demand & Shipment Forecasting \ud83d\udcc8",
  "space_description": "**Subindustry:** Logistics\n\n**Use case:** Load Demand Forecasting & Shipment Volume Prediction\n\nCargoSight Analytics \u2014 lane-level demand and capacity analytics across 20 shipping lanes (Domestic FTL, Domestic LTL, Cross-Border, Intermodal) and 8 distribution hubs. The S&OP Lead and Demand Planner use it to track forecast accuracy and reposition capacity; the VP Logistics monitors lane utilization and backlog risk; the CFO uses delivered freight revenue and freight charge trends for revenue assurance.\n\n**Key KPIs**\n- Forecast volume accuracy (actual / forecasted shipments) \u2014 target 95\u2013105%; MAPE goal <10% for established lanes\n- Capacity utilization % \u2014 lane fill rate; >85% on cross-border lanes signals capacity tightness\n- Backlog orders \u2014 orders awaiting capacity; leading indicator of customer escalations\n- Delivered freight revenue (USD) \u2014 top-line per lane / hub\n- On-time delivery rate \u2014 delivered / total orders\n- Average transit days \u2014 service-level metric for delivered shipments\n- Average wait hours for capacity \u2014 dock / hub throughput pressure\n- Delayed order count \u2014 service-quality signal by lane category\n\n**Data sources**\n- `shipment_orders` \u2014 daily order-level records: lane, hub, weight, freight charge, transit days, status\n- `demand_forecasts` \u2014 monthly forecast vs actual by lane and hub (shipments + weight) with model version\n- `capacity_snapshots` \u2014 weekly per-lane capacity, utilization %, backlog orders, and wait hours",
  "schema_basename": "load_forecasting",
